  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 130, right: 60, fontSize: 330, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EFF8', lineHeight: 1 }}>01</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 480, right: 80, width: 360, flexDirection: 'column', alignItems: 'flex-end', gap: 12 }}>
    {['任务动态到达与滞留', '规模—能力失配', '两阶段分层滚动求解'].map((k) => (
      <Box key={k} style={{ padding: '8px 18px', background: '#F0F5FC', borderRadius: 18, border: '1px solid #D6DCE5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#1E4FA8', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{k}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 200, left: 80, width: 760, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 4, background: '#FFC107' }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 5 }}>CHAPTER 01</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C', marginTop: 18 }}>研究问题与总体框架</Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 34, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18 }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 11 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7, flex: 1 }}>
          任务<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>动态到达、持续滞留</span>与无人机<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>状态动态变化</span>并存，规划必须周期性滚动进行
        </Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 12 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E4FA8', marginTop: 11 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.7, flex: 1 }}>
          任务规模与当前执行能力<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>经常失配</span>——不能全量求解，也不能随意丢弃任务
        </Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.8, marginTop: 30 }}>
      广域巡检场景中，静态一次性规划无法应对持续到达的任务流。本章先刻画问题特征，再给出「快速任务选择缩空间 + 精细 MUAS 组合优化」的两阶段总体求解框架。
    </Text>
    <Box style={{ marginTop: 24, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
      <Box style={{ padding: '7px 16px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>P4 · 五大挑战</Text>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ padding: '7px 16px', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>P5–P6 · 框架与滚动闭环</Text>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 76, left: 80, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'center' }}>
    {['01', '02', '03'].map((n, i) => (
      <Box key={n} style={{ padding: '6px 16px', borderRadius: 14, background: i === 0 ? '#1E4FA8' : '#F0F5FC' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: i === 0 ? '#FFFFFF' : '#8B97A8' }}>{n}</Text>
